LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T001200Z
DTSTART:20260725T203000Z
DTEND:20260725T223000Z
SUMMARY:Fallout 4 | Ep. 55 - The Brochure Forgot to Mention the Monsters
DESCRIPTION:Far Harbor continues to surprise us. Beautiful scenery,
 mysterious locals... and creatures that definitely weren't listed in the
 travel brochure. As the sole survivor of Vault 111, you enter a world
 destroyed by nuclear war. Every second is a fight for survival, and every
 choice is yours. Only you can rebuild and determine the fate of the
 Wasteland. Welcome home.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=RTw-kFMJsd4
CATEGORIES:Fallout 4
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
