DTSTART:20260727T203000Z
DTEND:20260727T223000Z
SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 41 - Nothing's More Permanent Than a
 Temporary Barrier
DESCRIPTION:Back to the construction site where today's \"temporary\"
 solutions may well become permanent landmarks. As always, we'll be
 building, digging, and hoping everything stays upright. Construction
 Simulator is back - bigger and better than ever! Take charge of over 70
 machines, dozens of them brand new to the franchise, and build to your
 heart's content on two huge maps - on your own or with your friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BSsq6DCJyD8
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24042211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260707T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T001200Z
DTSTART:20260728T203000Z
DTEND:20260728T223000Z
SUMMARY:DrainSim | Ep. 3 - That's a Beauty of a Blockage down at the
 Construction Site
DESCRIPTION:Our stylish action adventure continues with more acrobatic
 gunfights, impossible stunts, and enough slow-motion action to make every
 doorway feel optional. Dive into DrainSim and seize control of the floods!
 Clear the city's submerged streets, with a huge range of different tools
 from rakes to submersible pumps. Embrace the satisfaction of restoring the
 water flow. Become the city's hero, one drain at a time.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ez9MNBlTTDk
CATEGORIES:DrainSim
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
