SUMMARY:Sniper Elite III | Ep. 10 - Save Churchill Part 1: In Shadows DLC
DESCRIPTION:It's time to begin the In Shadows DLC as we take on the
 mission to protect Churchill. Expect tense stealth, careful planning, and
 plenty of precision shooting. Sniper Elite 3 is a tactical third-person
 shooter that combines stealth, gameplay choice and genre-defining
 ballistics with huge, open levels and the exotic terrain of World War 2
 North Africa.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Sniper Elite III
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
