SUMMARY:WET | Ep. 1 - Cool People Don't Use Stairs
DESCRIPTION:Drainage engineering returns! Construction projects inevitably
 create problems... thankfully we've got the equipment (and hopefully the
 patience) to clear them. A stylish action shooter that blends fast-paced
 gunplay, sword combat, and cinematic acrobatics. Players follow mercenary
 Rubi Malone as she takes on dangerous jobs, battling through waves of
 enemies using slow-motion stunts inspired by classic action films. Expect
 explosive set pieces, over-the-top action, and plenty of style.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:WET
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
