SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 17 - Every Trail Leads to Trouble
 Eventually
DESCRIPTION:The frontier continues to test us as another chapter unfolds,
 bringing memorable encounters, difficult choices, and breathtaking
 landscapes. Arthur Morgan and the Van der Linde Gang are outlaws on the
 run. With federal agents and bounty hunters massing on their heels, the
 gang must rob, steal, and fight their way across the rugged heartland in
 order to survive.
